<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen Jan-Oct industry output up 25.3 pct vs '95.</title>
<headline>Turkmen Jan-Oct industry output up 25.3 pct vs '95.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGHABAD 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan industrial production in the first 10 months of this year was 25.3-percent higher than in the same period of 1995, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    TURKMEN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	 Jan-Oct 96    Jan-Sep 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	     +25.3	   +25.9</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
